            <h1>The Timed Agenda: Give Every Topic a Time Slot</h1>
            <p>An agenda without times is a wish list. Add time slots and it becomes a plan.</p>
            <a href="/auth/google" class="hero-cta">Build a Timed Agenda - Free</a>
